<title>COLOMBIA: TABLE - BAVARIA H1 NET PROFITS UP 37.6 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BAVARIA H1 NET PROFITS UP 37.6 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombian brewing giant Bavaria posted the following first-half results:</p>
<p>			First-half 1997		First-half 1996</p>
<p>Net profits	   71.6 billion pesos    Profits 52.07 billion</p>
<p>Operating profit    43.2 billion			20.6 billion</p>
<p>Operating revenues 394.8 billion		     381.3 billion</p>
<p>Total assets	 4.57 trillion		     3.86 trillion.</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos and subject to verification by the Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
